WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:04.547
Hi! Let me tell you about our plans for Saturday.

2
00:00:05.997 --> 00:00:11.245
We decided last week: we're going to play volleyball at the beach.

3
00:00:11.695 --> 00:00:13.228
It's our plan!

4
00:00:15.478 --> 00:00:19.286
But look at those clouds! It's going to rain.

5
00:00:19.736 --> 00:00:20.897
Oh, no!

6
00:00:23.147 --> 00:00:28.116
OK, new idea! I'll call our friends. We'll go to the cinema!

7
00:00:28.566 --> 00:00:30.191
I decided now.

8
00:00:32.441 --> 00:00:36.481
And I'll make some popcorn for everybody before the movie.

9
00:00:36.931 --> 00:00:39.764
I promise I won't burn it this time!

10
00:00:42.014 --> 00:00:45.590
Plans change, but it's going to be a fun day.

11
00:00:46.040 --> 00:00:49.105
And you? What are you going to do on Saturday?

